| 1. Foundation | Lucide icons, Skeleton, Sidebar redesign, WebSocket migration, theme system | Sidebar, Layout, index.css, AnalysisPage, BacktestPage, PortfolioPage, package.json |
| 2. Agent Flow | AgentFlowPage, DebateView, ReportCard, ConfidenceMeter, AnalysisPage tabs | New components + pages, client.ts, types |
